2026-09-21 05:10:38,701 DEBUG   agents.skills.client: run_skill: raw_response='I\'ll help you classify this issue. Let me start by reading the skill file to understand the exact requirements and output format.\nLet me try with bash to read the skill file:\nNow I\'ll analyze the issue content and classify it according to the skill requirements:\n\n**Analysis:**\n- **Severity indicators:** 500 errors blocking checkout functionality\n- **Impact scope:** ~15% of checkout attempts affected (significant)\n- **Business impact:** 8 support complaints in the past hour (active customer impact)\n- **Root cause identified:** Correlated with yesterday\'s pricing-service deployment\n- **Functional impact:** Critical business flow (checkout) is degraded\n\n**Classification reasoning:**\nThis issue exhibits all the hallmarks of a **critical** priority:\n1. Core business function (checkout/payment) is broken\n2. Customer-facing impact with multiple complaints\n3. Affects a substantial percentage of transactions (15%)\n4. Affects real customers right now (8 complaints in past hour)\n5. Revenue impact is direct and immediate\n6. Issue root cause identified (deployment correlation)\n\n**Confidence:** Very high (0.95) - the combination of checkout failure + customer impact + quantifiable scope clearly maps to "critical"\n\n**Fallback used:** false - the classification is clear and well-above confidence thresholds\n\n```json\n{\n  "label": "critical",\n  "confidence": 0.95,\n  "fallback_used": false\n}\n```'
